{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0a29aa9dc5a833d8b09","chatId":"cde37391657d4f259045f08490e90289","sessionId":null,"userId":98285,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1638,"promptTokens":1500,"completionTokens":102,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:58"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035924831361078898,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0a29aa9dc5a833d8b08","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482338612,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0a29aa9dc5a833d8b08","chatId":"cde37391657d4f259045f08490e90289","sessionId":null,"userId":98285,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n莉丝为了买到她梦寐以求的汽车已经工作了很长一段时间。在经过长时间的储蓄后，她终于在今天买到了。与此同时，她的弟弟比尔正在经历财务困境，几周前不得不卖掉他的车。那天晚上，莉丝决定带比尔乘坐她的新车出去兜风。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，比尔最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 伤心\nB) 激动\nC) 悔恨\nD) 失望\nE) 绝望\nF) 愧疚\n\n## 问题 2\n比尔为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 由于财务困境，比尔不得不卖掉自己的车\nB) 他不喜欢爱丽丝的新车\nC) 爱丽丝没有邀请他搭乘她的新车\nD) 他工作比爱丽丝更努力","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035924831361078898,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0a29aa9dc5a833d8b09","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482338609,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f2a8a9496ea048e6bd6f8f5b72ac2168"}